  "bio": {
    "heading": "Biography",
    "portrait": {
      "sources": {},
      "img": {
        "src": "/Assets/Photos/IMG_1228.JPG",
        "w": 1600,
        "h": 1200
      }
    },
    "captionName": "Papocito",
    "captionPlace": "Gainesville, FL",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Born in South Florida in 1993, Ayo Papo, known as **\"Papocito,\"** grew up moving across the state, absorbing and being shaped by the competitive spirit of Fort Myers and the Latin and R&B sounds of his household. The result is a signature style of uniquely pocketed compositions that carry the warmth, grit, and groove of the South.",
      "Inspired by the genre-defying artistry of Sam Gellaitry, Dominic Fike, and Kid Cudi, his music is melodic yet raw, polished yet deeply personal. His singles _Gushy_ featuring LocalHotBoy and _Jook Jook_ featuring WhoDidIt? highlight his ability to blend infectious energy with intentional lyricism, and his upcoming project _Juice Worth The Squeeze_ is set to be his most ambitious work yet.",
      "With a refined sound and a clear vision, Papocito is stepping into his moment."
    ]
  },
